# Build-time linking produces the static scene program consumed by both hosts.
import program.dl
import lib/filesystem.dl

read the file at "/input.json" and set input to it
require condition (input succeeded) reporting "The Farm shader linker requires its compiled stages"
parse (input's contents) as JSON and set parsed to it
require condition (parsed succeeded) reporting "The Farm shader linker received invalid stage data"
set program to the website Farm render graph using (parsed's value)
print line the compact JSON form of program
free program
free parsed's value
